# Graphify Rule

This workflow is not active by default in the starter template. Copy this file into `.cursor/rules/` only if the project intentionally adopts Graphify and has completed setup.

When Graphify is configured for a project, use graph queries to orient before broad code exploration, architecture review, or dependency tracing.

Do not assume Graphify exists for every project. If graph output is missing, unavailable, stale, or intentionally excluded, use normal code exploration and document that Graphify was not used.
